    <h3 data-id="pg013_n0005" class="adt-h3 inline-block bg-green-400 text-slate-900 px-4 py-2 font-semibold rounded-sm">Situata 1.</h3>
    <p class="adt-body mt-4 leading-relaxed text-left">
      <span data-id="pg013_n0007">Ishin dit&#xeb;t e fundit t&#xeb; gushtit, kur Lisi po rregullonte dhom&#xeb;n e tij t&#xeb; gjumit para fillimit t&#xeb; vitit shkollor.</span>
      <span data-id="pg013_n0008">Do ta fillonte klas&#xeb;n e kat&#xeb;rt dhe kjo e b&#xeb;nte m&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;s ndaj gj&#xeb;rave t&#xeb; tij.</span>
      <span data-id="pg013_n0009">Lisi &#xeb;sht&#xeb; idhtar i rip&#xeb;rdorimit dhe i riciklimit dhe ai &#xe7;do vit shikon se &#xe7;far&#xeb; i ka mbetur nga viti i kaluar shkollor p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;i p&#xeb;rdorur n&#xeb; vitin e ardhsh&#xeb;m.</span>
      <span data-id="pg013_n0010">Mir&#xeb;po, di&#xe7;ka q&#xeb; nuk i duhej m&#xeb;, por q&#xeb; kishin shum&#xeb; vler&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb;, ishin librat e tij t&#xeb; par&#xeb;.</span>
      <span data-id="pg013_n0011">Mendoi t&#x2019;i vendoste diku n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pi p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;i ruajtur, por e dinte q&#xeb; k&#xeb;shtu nuk b&#xeb;nte mir&#xeb; p&#xeb;r ask&#xeb;nd.</span>
      <span data-id="pg013_n0012">Kur bisedoi me prind&#xeb;rit p&#xeb;r k&#xeb;t&#xeb; &#xe7;&#xeb;shtje, ata i dhan&#xeb; nj&#xeb; ide t&#xeb; shk&#xeb;lqyeshme.</span>
      <span data-id="pg013_n0013">- Pse nuk mbledh libra edhe nga shok&#xeb;t e klas&#xeb;s dhe t&#xeb; krijoni bibliotek&#xeb;n e klas&#xeb;s? - ishte ideja e p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t e prind&#xeb;rve.</span>
      <span data-id="pg013_n0014">Lisi u lumturua shum&#xeb; nga kjo ide.</span>
      <span data-id="pg013_n0015">E mendonte sa mir&#xeb; do t&#xeb; b&#xeb;hej kur t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t e klas&#xeb;s do t&#xeb; mblidhnin librat e tyre dhe t&#x2019;i shk&#xeb;mbenin me nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin.</span>
    </p>
