        <span data-id="pg013_n0030">Njer&#xeb;zit dallojn&#xeb; nga nj&#xeb;ri-tjetri.</span>
        <span data-id="pg013_n0031">Ata jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; familje, mjedise t&#xeb; ndryshme, kan&#xeb; edukat&#xeb; dhe kultura t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span>
        <span data-id="pg013_n0032">K&#xeb;shtu q&#xeb;, secili njeri ka mendimet e veta.</span>
        <span data-id="pg013_n0033">N&#xeb;se respektojm&#xeb; kulturat dhe mendimet e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve dhe i shk&#xeb;mbejm&#xeb; ato n&#xeb; mes nesh, at&#xeb;her&#xeb; &#xe7;do pun&#xeb; b&#xeb;het m&#xeb; mir&#xeb; dhe ne b&#xeb;hemi m&#xeb; t&#xeb; ditur, pasi p&#xeb;rfitojm&#xeb; shum&#xeb; nga t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t.</span>
        <span data-id="pg013_n0034">Pun&#xeb; n&#xeb; ekip do t&#xeb; thot&#xeb; kur disa persona punojn&#xeb; s&#xeb; bashku p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; arritur nj&#xeb; q&#xeb;llim t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t ose p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; kryer nj&#xeb; detyr&#xeb; sa m&#xeb; mir&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg013_n0035">Puna n&#xeb; ekip nuk njeh mosh&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg013_n0036">Ajo &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjitha moshat.</span>
